# The image build context is images/ (so the Dockerfiles can COPY lib/*).
#
# lib/eslint/ is a package.json + lockfile and a flat config; the tree they
# describe is installed INSIDE the image by install-dev-tools.sh (`npm ci`). A
# node_modules/ left there by someone running the toolchain from a checkout
# would otherwise be copied into the context — megabytes of host-built binaries
# that `npm ci` deletes on its first line anyway, and that carry the host's
# platform rather than the image's.
lib/eslint/node_modules
lib/oxfmt/node_modules
